{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-of-debt","title":"债务的成本与利息模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-management/foundations/cost-of-debt","wordCount":1942,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"债务的成本与利息模型\">债务的成本与利息模型</h1><p>「我们欠了很多技术债」这句话之所以难以驱动任何决策，是因为它没有单位。一笔欠款如果说不清本金多少、利息多高，银行不会放贷，CFO 也不会拨款。技术债务同理：要让它进入资源竞争，必须给它定价。本篇把上一篇分好类的债务转换成可计算的数字——本金怎么估、利息怎么算、利率由什么决定、以及 2026 年关于债务经济代价的真实量级。这套定价模型是 <a href=\"../identification/debt-metrics\">债务度量与量化</a>的理论基础，也是 <a href=\"../management/prioritization-frameworks\">优先级框架与决策</a>排序函数的核心变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>金融隐喻里的三个量在软件里都有具体对应。本金 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是「现在把这块代码做对所需的一次性工作量」，通常以人天计；利息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是「因为它没做对，每次相关开发要额外多付的成本」；利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 则刻画利息相对本金的比例与增长速度。一笔债在时间窗内的累积成本可以粗略写成本金加上历次利息之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}} = P + \\sum_{t=1}^{n} I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中关键洞见在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是常数。利息的大小正比于该模块被触碰的频率——一段一年没人改的代码，利息近乎为零；一段每周都要改的核心代码，每次改动都在付息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一笔技术债] --&gt; B[本金 P&lt;br/&gt;修正的一次性成本]&#10;  A --&gt; C[利率 r&lt;br/&gt;由改动频率决定]&#10;  C --&gt; D[利息 I_t&lt;br/&gt;每次开发的额外成本]&#10;  D --&gt; E{该模块改动频繁?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是, 高频| F[利息大且复利&lt;br/&gt;优先偿还]&#10;  E --&gt;|否, 冷区| G[利息近零&lt;br/&gt;可长期持有]&#10;  B --&gt; H{还本金?}&#10;  H --&gt;|重构, 付出 P| I[利息归零]&#10;  H --&gt;|不还| J[持续累积 I_t]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一笔技术债] --&gt; B[本金 P&lt;br/&gt;修正的一次性成本]\n  A --&gt; C[利率 r&lt;br/&gt;由改动频率决定]\n  C --&gt; D[利息 I_t&lt;br/&gt;每次开发的额外成本]\n  D --&gt; E{该模块改动频繁?}\n  E --&gt;|是, 高频| F[利息大且复利&lt;br/&gt;优先偿还]\n  E --&gt;|否, 冷区| G[利息近零&lt;br/&gt;可长期持有]\n  B --&gt; H{还本金?}\n  H --&gt;|重构, 付出 P| I[利息归零]\n  H --&gt;|不还| J[持续累积 I_t]</pre><p>把利率高低和本金大小放到同一张表上，就得到了最朴素的偿还决策矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>利率（改动频率）</th>\n<th>本金（修复成本）</th>\n<th>决策建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>立刻还，性价比最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>优先规划，渐进偿还</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>顺手就还，否则忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>暂不还，长期持有，监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张矩阵解释了一个反直觉的结论：<strong>不是所有债都该还</strong>。一笔本金巨大但几乎不计息（冷区、无人触碰）的债，理性选择是放着不管，把还债预算投到高利率的债上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利率为什么由改动频率决定\">利率为什么由改动频率决定</h2><p>利息只在「与债务相关的开发」发生时才产生——你不碰这块代码，它就不向你收费。因此利率的本质是该代码未来被触碰的概率密度。这给度量带来一个极实用的代理指标：版本控制里的<strong>改动频率</strong>（churn）。一个文件过去半年被改动的次数，近似就是它的利率。把改动频率乘以代码复杂度，得到的就是「热点」——既复杂又频繁改动的代码，是利息最高、最该优先偿还的债。热点的工程化识别见 <a href=\"../identification/code-quality-signals\">代码质量信号与坏味道</a>。</p>\n<p>形式化地，可以把单位时间利息近似为复杂度与改动频率的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>∝</mo><mtext>complexity</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>churn</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I \\propto \\text{complexity} \\times \\text{churn}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">complexity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这也解释了为什么纯复杂度排名会误导——一段复杂但没人碰的代码，复杂度高、利率低，实际利息很小，把还债资源花在它身上是浪费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sqale-把债务折算成工时\">SQALE：把债务折算成工时</h2><p>要让本金可比较，需要一个统一单位。业界最成熟的方案是 SQALE 模型（Software Quality Assessment based on Lifecycle Expectations），它是 SonarQube 等工具的底层模型。SQALE 的做法是给每一类问题预设一个「修复时间」（remediation effort），把代码里检测到的所有问题乘以各自的修复时间再求和，得到一个总数，比如「这个项目有 45 天的技术债」。</p>\n<p>由此可以定义技术债比率（technical debt ratio）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TDR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>修复全部债务的成本</mtext><mtext>从零重写系统的成本</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TDR} = \\frac{\\text{修复全部债务的成本}}{\\text{从零重写系统的成本}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TDR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">从零重写系统的成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">修复全部债务的成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>SonarQube 默认用这个比率把项目映射成 A 到 E 的可维护性评级。SQALE 的价值是把模糊的「债很多」变成可放进合同、可向管理层汇报的具体数字；它的局限是只覆盖代码层、且修复时间是预设估值。如何正确解读和补足这些局限，见 <a href=\"../identification/debt-metrics\">债务度量与量化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年债务的真实经济量级\">2026 年债务的真实经济量级</h2><p>利息模型不是纸上谈兵，宏观数据印证了它的复利威力。Stripe 的开发者系数报告发现，开发者平均每周有约 42% 的工作时间消耗在处理技术债与糟糕代码上——其中约 13.5 小时花在技术债、另有约 3.8 小时在修复劣质代码，折算成全球生产力损失约 850 亿美元。McKinsey 对 220 家公司的研究显示，技术债最低的一批公司，营收增速比技术债最高的一批高出约 20%；同时约 30% 的 CIO 认为超过 20% 的技术预算被债务偿还吞噬。Gartner 则预测到 2026 年约 80% 的技术债将是架构层债务，这正对应利息模型里「越深的债利率越高、越难还」的结论。</p>\n<p>这些数字的共同信息是：技术债的成本不是线性累加而是复利吞噬产能。利息一旦逼近团队总产能，系统就进入技术性破产——任何新功能都做不动。避免破产的关键，是在利息复利之前就用本金把高利率的债还掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利息的复利与技术性破产\">利息的复利与技术性破产</h2><p>利息模型里最容易被低估的，是利息的复利性质——这正是 Cunningham 当年强调的核心。债务不只是让每次相关开发多付固定成本，它还会让你在错误的理解和结构之上继续构建新东西，于是新代码也跟着扭曲，债务向外蔓延。一段没有测试、结构混乱的核心模块，会迫使依赖它的每个新功能都绕着它的怪癖写，新功能本身又欠下新债。利息因此不是线性累加，而是接近指数增长。</p>\n<p>复利的终局是「技术性破产」：当维护现状的利息支出逼近团队的全部产能，新功能就再也做不动了——团队所有时间都花在和已有债务搏斗上。这在数学上对应一个临界点：当单位时间利息总和接近团队容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 时，可用于创造新价值的净产能趋近于零。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净产能</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净产能} = C - \\sum_{i} I_i \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净产能</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>避免破产的唯一办法，是在利息复利失控之前，用本金把高利率的债主动还掉——这把话题直接引向了优先级排序，见 <a href=\"../management/prioritization-frameworks\">优先级框架与决策</a>。理解复利，也解释了为什么债务「拖着不还」几乎总比「及时偿还」更贵：拖延付出的不是固定罚款，而是不断放大的利息基数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>给债务定价是让它进入资源竞争的前提；模型由本金 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、利息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 三量构成。</li>\n<li>利率由改动频率决定，利息近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>complexity</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>churn</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{complexity} \\times \\text{churn}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">complexity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此「热点」是利息最高的债。</li>\n<li>决策矩阵的反直觉结论：本金大但利率低的冷区债应当长期持有、不还。</li>\n<li>SQALE 把债务折算成工时、定义技术债比率 TDR，是把「债很多」变成可汇报数字的成熟方案，但只覆盖代码层。</li>\n<li>2026 数据印证复利威力：开发者约 42% 工时耗于债务，低债公司营收增速高约 20%，约 80% 的债将是架构债。</li>\n<li>这套定价模型直接喂给<a href=\"../identification/debt-metrics\">度量</a>与<a href=\"../management/prioritization-frameworks\">优先级排序</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>数据来源：Stripe Developer Coefficient Report（开发者每周约 42% 工时、约 850 亿美元损失）；McKinsey, &quot;Tech debt: Reclaiming tech equity&quot;（220 家公司、营收增速高约 20%、30% CIO 数据）；Gartner（2026 年约 80% 债务为架构债）；SonarSource SQALE 文档。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"债务的成本与利息模型","id":"债务的成本与利息模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"利率为什么由改动频率决定","id":"利率为什么由改动频率决定"},{"level":2,"text":"SQALE：把债务折算成工时","id":"sqale-把债务折算成工时"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年债务的真实经济量级","id":"2026-年债务的真实经济量级"},{"level":2,"text":"利息的复利与技术性破产","id":"利息的复利与技术性破产"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"技术债务的分类与象限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-management/foundations/debt-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"代码质量信号与坏味道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-management/identification/code-quality-signals"}}